      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's a draft summary that highlights the project's impact:\n\n\"In the Sahel region, our $5M campaign has sparked a profound impact, transforming the lives of 19,000 individuals through the completion of 48 life-giving wells. By supporting our clean water initiative, our donors have invested in a major catalyst for rural development, breaking cycles of poverty and enabling villages to thrive. Their contributions have created a lasting legacy of community-led progress, as this season of hard work has not only reversed years of drought but has put our partner villages firmly on the path to a brighter, more sustainable future. This is your funding in action.\"",
